{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_AAFFF24D","title":"Ava coaches how to beat Gideon","entry":"Dlg_AAFFF24D::entry","exit":"Dlg_AAFFF24D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_210EF06B","articyId":"72057645577584745","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"We cannot beat him. We should reconsider.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We cannot beat him. We should reconsider.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":475.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19604","byteOffset":15299248,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_9147CF29","articyId":"72057645577584751","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh?","TextSheVersion":"Huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":775.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44890","byteOffset":31316528,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_DD3F0EE4","articyId":"72057645577584759","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Gideon. He is close. I have identified the Grey Tech he possesses. It's a Disquiet Module from Orion Technologies. I can't overcome such sophisticated intrusion tech. No effective digital immunization exists.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gideon. He is close. I have identified the Grey Tech he possesses. It's a Disquiet Module from Orion Technologies. I can't overcome such sophisticated intrusion tech. No effective digital immunization exists.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27978","byteOffset":18465240,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_8B4E47D7","articyId":"72057645577584766","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I thought you said you could stop him hacking you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought you said you could stop him hacking you?","TextSheVersion":"I thought you said you could stop him hacking you?","TextTheyVersion":"I thought you said you could stop him hacking you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26385","byteOffset":17863896,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_5012C73E","articyId":"72057645577584772","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You can do this Ava!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You can do this Ava!","TextSheVersion":"You can do this Ava!","TextTheyVersion":"You can do this Ava!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39803","byteOffset":29388416,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_814AB859","articyId":"72057645577584780","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"Wait, perhaps there is a way. Not to beat him, but to delay him. Stall him long enough that I won't be compromised, but I can still trace the owner.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wait, perhaps there is a way. Not to beat him, but to delay him. Stall him long enough that I won't be compromised, but I can still trace the owner.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1975.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50063","byteOffset":33282832,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_0BD76AF0","articyId":"72057645577585099","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How?","TextSheVersion":"How?","TextTheyVersion":"How?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21001","byteOffset":15827144,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_FACF7E15","articyId":"72057645577585106","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have already engaged immunization protocols, but they will only slow the intrusion, not stop it. However, if Gideon's Automata is distracted with other subroutines, we might hold out long enough.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have already engaged immunization protocols, but they will only slow the intrusion, not stop it. However, if Gideon's Automata is distracted with other subroutines, we might hold out long enough.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2575.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27121","byteOffset":18139400,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_A262B821","articyId":"72057645577585113","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do I distract him?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do I distract him?","TextSheVersion":"How do I distract him?","TextTheyVersion":"How do I distract him?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2875.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38267","byteOffset":28812624,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_8A46D80E","articyId":"72057645577585120","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Ava","text":"We need Gideon's Automata to constantly check facts, details and news sources during your conversation with him.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We need Gideon's Automata to constantly check facts, details and news sources during your conversation with him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3175.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45757","byteOffset":31642704,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_2ABFE3C7","articyId":"72057645577585127","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So I should ask lots of questions?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So I should ask lots of questions?","TextSheVersion":"So I should ask lots of questions?","TextTheyVersion":"So I should ask lots of questions?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48729","byteOffset":32772040,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_A114D783","articyId":"72057645577585132","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I should try to say as little as possible?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I should try to say as little as possible?","TextSheVersion":"I should try to say as little as possible?","TextTheyVersion":"I should try to say as little as possible?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37445","byteOffset":28504688,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_66895E22","articyId":"72057645577585140","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need to constantly change topic.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need to constantly change topic.","TextSheVersion":"I need to constantly change topic.","TextTheyVersion":"I need to constantly change topic."},"effects":[],"condition